32,\"totalTokens\":16402}}","description":"Mikoviny WP Custom Pages 模块（WordPress 插件，版本 0.5.0.1）的 wp-download.php 文件存在目录遍历（路径遍历）漏洞，属于 CWE-22 类型。该脚本在处理用户传入的 `url` 参数时未对路径进行充分校验与规范化，远程攻击者可在 `url` 参数中插入经过 URL 编码的 `..%2F`（即编码后的\"点点斜杠\"）序列，借此跨越 Web 根目录限制并读取服务器上的任意文件（如配置文件、源码或敏感系统文件）。该漏洞影响所有安装并使用此插件 0.5.0.1 版本的 WordPress 站点，利用条件仅需攻击者能够网络访问目标站点的 wp-download.php 接口，无需身份认证，通过构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可实现任意文件读取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1669"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-04-10T02:51:20Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:29:47Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 WordPress 插件 WP Custom Pages 至 0.5.0.2 或更高版本（官方已修复该目录遍历漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或 Nginx/Apache 配置规则拦截包含 `..%2F` 或 `../` 等路径遍历序列的 `url` 参数请求，或临时禁用该插件的 `wp-download.php` 文件访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/71707","http://secunia.com/advisories/43963","http://www.autosectools.com/Advisories/WordPress.WP.Custom.Pages.0.5.0.1_Local.File.Inclusion_169.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17119","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/47146","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/66559","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/17119","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-1669.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-1669.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-1669.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-1669.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/c8e5b5fa7d3cc58de338ca5a0a33eeafcde1afac/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-16xx/CVE-2011-1669.json","https://github.com/masahiro331/nvd-list/blob/4937ab886b2d99e2047bc7eafc242f2653ee7558/cves/2011/CVE-2011-1669.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2011-1669_19.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2011-1669-2045.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2011-1669-2041.yaml","https://github.com/thompson005/nuclei-scanner/blob/6b5cfd844640c882a3d278f76f395a74ee14ef81/nucleivault/new%20templates/CVE-2011-1669-2041.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/07cfc0edf465277028554b47198f6f186d3215b6/data/CVE-2011-1669.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0062","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-1167","title":"LibTIFF ThunderCode解码器堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"LibTIFF 3.9.4及更早版本中的ThunderScan解码器（tif_thunder.c）存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理包含异常BitsPerSample值的THUNDER_2BITDELTAS数据的特制.tiff文件时，解码器未正确验证输入数据长度，导致堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可向目标用户发送恶意构造的TIFF图像文件，诱使用户使用受影响版本的LibTIFF库解析该文件，从而触发缓冲区溢出，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用LibTIFF库的Linux发行版及各类图像处理应用，CVSS评分6.8，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-1167"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-03-28T16:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:28:51Z","remediation":"升级 LibTIFF 至 4.0.0 或更高版本。各 Linux 发行版用户可通过包管理器更新：Red Hat/CentOS 运行 `yum update libtiff`，Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade libtiff`，Fedora 运行 `yum update libtiff`。Apple iOS 用户升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用 TIFF 图像的 ThunderCode 解码支持作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blackberry.com/btsc/KB27244","http://bugzilla.maptools.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2300","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2