illa.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=624621","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65951","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14369","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2011/1xxx/CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-1187","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2011/UBUNTU-CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/vex/cve/2011/CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2011/CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-1187","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-1187.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-1187.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0004","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0762","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9205,\"outputTokens\":24,\"totalTokens\":10893}}","description":"vsftpd 2.3.3 之前版本的 ls.c 文件中的 vsf_filename_passes_filter 函数存在拒绝服务漏洞。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可在多个 FTP 会话中通过 STAT 命令发送精心构造的 glob 通配符表达式（如复杂的嵌套匹配模式）触发该漏洞，导致服务器 CPU 资源被大量消耗并耗尽进程槽位，最终造成服务拒绝。该漏洞属于资源不受控制的消耗（CWE-400）类型，攻击条件要求攻击者拥有有效的 FTP 登录凭证，CVSS 评分 4.0，危害等级中等。此漏洞与 CVE-2010-2632 为不同的缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0762"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-03-02T20:00:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:28:01Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 vsftpd 到 2.3.3 或更高版本（如 3.0.3 等稳定版），以修复 vsf_filename_passes_filter 函数中的 glob 表达式拒绝服务漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 FTP 服务器配置中限制单用户最大并发会话数（如 max_per_ip=2、max_clients=50），并在防火墙层面限制单 IP 并发 FTP 连接数，缓解 CPU 耗尽与进程槽耗尽风险。建议同时监控 FTP 服务进程数与 CPU 占用，异常时自动重启服务或封禁异常 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=622741","http://cxib.net/stuff/vspoc232.c","http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN37417423/index.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-March/055881.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-March/055882.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2011-March/055957.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-05/msg00005.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133226187115472&w=2","http://securityreason.com/achievement_securityalert/95","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8109","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2305","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16270","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/590604","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:049","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-0337.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/516748/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/46617","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1025186","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1098-1","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0547","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0639","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0668","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0713","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65873","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16270","http